#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:13
#: 4c249f710f0d413a945d62ad7f835b8b
msgid "Pico Enterprise vs consumer"
msgstr "Pico 企业版与消费版"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:16
#: b162c55bd4b64163a92de384ca61305d
msgid ""
"Treat **Pico Enterprise** and **Pico consumer** as different SKUs. Each "
"edition has its own headset App."
msgstr "将 **Pico 企业版** 和 **Pico 消费版** 视为不同 SKU。不要把同一个头显 App 写成同时覆盖两者。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:18
#: ea10a3c63faa480aadb4a8047bba9f00
msgid ""
"**USB shared networking (USB 网络共享)** — Pico Enterprise can share a "
"network with the ROS 2 PC over USB. That is an Enterprise capability; it "
"is not the consumer Pico path."
msgstr "**USB 网络共享** — Pico 企业版可通过 USB 与 ROS 2 主机共享网络。这是企业版能力，不是消费版 Pico 的路径。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:19
#: 84791f1586de45ecab2c446eedddaeff
msgid ""
"**Different Apps** — Enterprise and consumer Pico use **different** "
"headset Apps. Install the App that matches the headset edition. The fa-"
"py-libraries README’s XRoboToolkit path is “XRoboToolkit App + PC "
"Service” versus browser WebXR; it does not name a single store listing "
"for both Pico editions."
msgstr ""
"**不同的 App** — 企业版与消费版 Pico 使用**不同的**头显 App。请安装与头显版本匹配的 App。fa-py-"
"libraries README 的 XRoboToolkit 路径是「XRoboToolkit App + PC Service」对比浏览器 "
"WebXR；它没有给出同时覆盖两个 Pico 版本的商店条目。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:21
#: e2258585de964b43aabacbc13df0454a
msgid ""
"Store listings, extra package names, and ADB steps are in the headset / "
"fa-py-libraries READMEs when they document them."
msgstr "商店链接、额外包名和 ADB 步骤以头显 / fa-py-libraries README 写明的为准。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:24
#: 8025a2fd6fdb40638094040b5a412664
msgid "Pico Recommended"
msgstr "推荐 Pico"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:27
#: 22ebd0feef024d398d8c210e68212d24
msgid ""
"**Pico Enterprise** is the preferred Pico SKU for VR teleop (USB 网络共享, "
"matching Enterprise App, lower-latency tracking / 更跟手). Consumer Pico and"
" Meta Quest still work with the WebXR (`./run.sh vr`) and XRoboToolkit "
"(`./run.sh vr-xrt`) backends."
msgstr ""
"**Pico 企业版** 是 VR 遥操作首选的 Pico SKU（USB 网络共享、匹配的企业版 App、更低延迟追踪 / 更跟手）。消费版 "
"Pico 和 Meta Quest 仍可使用 WebXR（`./run.sh vr`）和 XRoboToolkit（`./run.sh vr-"
"xrt`）后端。"

